    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Estates are delighted to bring to the market this beautiful apartment in *** IMMACULATE CONDITION THROUGHOUT *** Situated in a very popular and well located development. Number 14 comes to the market in excellent condition throughout with a turn key finish. \n\nThis property has been fully renovated throughout, offering a fresh, modern and move in ready home. The accommodation provides well proportioned living space together with two comfortable size bedrooms and a contemporary bathroom. \n\nThe property also benefits from both a front and fear garden providing excellent outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining or enjoying the warmer months. \n\nIf your downsizing, a first time buyer or an investor this property is suited to you. This attractive home combines modern interiors with the convenience of a well established residential setting. \n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the quality and finish of this lovely home. \n\nPlease note: Visit Kelly Estates on Facebook, Instagram or Tiktok for videos of the property. Early interest is expected, be sure to contact Kelly Estates today for further information or to arrange viewing! All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
